      "date": "2026-03-12T07:08:09.000Z",
      "title": "ULTRACEMCO: Capacity Expansion Will Drive Future Upside Despite Ongoing GST Disputes",
      "body": "Analysts have inched up their fair value estimate for UltraTech Cement to ₹14,090.92 from ₹14,084.45. This reflects small tweaks to assumptions on discount rate, revenue growth, profit margin and future P/E rather than any major shift in the underlying view.",
