      "body": "Analysts have slightly increased their price target on UltraTech Cement from ₹13,965.85 to ₹14,061.95, citing updated assumptions for revenue growth, profit margins, discount rate and future P/E multiple in their valuation work. What's in the News Multiple GST enforcement orders issued to UltraTech Cement by authorities in Tamil Nadu for alleged excess Input Tax Credit (ITC) in FY 2021-22 and FY 2019-20, with combined tax demands of about ₹10.36m and ₹93.54m, along with associated interest and penalties.",
